        "weber REP 933 (pump concrete 0-8 mm, C40/50) is a dry concrete that is mixed with water only into a ready-to-use, pumpable concrete. Its flowable consistency makes it particularly suitable for dense reinforcement, and it has good resistance to de-icing salt, among other things. Repair class R4 to EN 1504-3. Intended for heavy structures from 50 mm and designed for piston pumps.",
